		{"id":"d88790449ae01038","type":"file","file":"Terra-Oblivia/Scratch/TO Core Themes.md","x":-220,"y":-1580,"width":739,"height":878},
		{"id":"a1836f9085fa877a","type":"text","text":"# [[What is the Reshaping]]","x":610,"y":-1880,"width":1980,"height":140},
		{"id":"d2a6a7d1fa740173","type":"text","text":"# THE GODS RESHAPED","x":-360,"y":-580,"width":400,"height":180},
		{"id":"e6cbbe2f76e8369d","type":"text","text":"The World's Name","x":980,"y":-1260,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"c78f84d90f67b544","type":"text","text":"Terra-Nova: In world this name means New Land. Terra-Nova was named for its fresh, bright, and endless future. It is no longer so bright, or so hopeful. \n\nThe name of the world must change, to reflect the new state in which it exists.\n\nIdeas:\n- *Terra-Cicatrix*: Scar Land, Scarred Land, land of Scars, comes from the Scars that are used to reshape the Gods and the land\n- *Terra-Oblivia*: Land of Oblivion, comes from Oblivati Mori\n\n\n## TERRA-OBLIVIA\n\nThis is the new name, the new state of the world, and the new challenge each mortal faces to survive. Terra-Oblivia","x":980,"y":-1160,"width":530,"height":915},
		{"id":"7b642cf252db6534","type":"text","text":"What is changed outside of the Gods?\n\nEverything! Everything cahnges, and the world is twisted so deeply it becomes a world alien to its own inhabitants.","x":1320,"y":-1580,"width":280,"height":265},
		{"id":"6fbe96f573a62932","type":"text","text":"Mortals","x":1680,"y":-1260,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3813a7c2cbdf797d","type":"text","text":"","x":1680,"y":-1157,"width":530,"height":915},
		{"id":"36b2e9e579a860da","type":"text","text":"# PILLARS / RULES OF THE RESHAPING","x":-60,"y":-1990,"width":419,"height":360},
		{"id":"2cb2fb06e89d85be","x":-1080,"y":-400,"width":1840,"height":1120,"type":"file","file":"Terra-Oblivia/Religion/Terra-Oblivia Pantheon.md"}
